  "verified_corrections": [
    "real oracle validity requires 15 complete outcomes, no error, integer nonnegative exit. Oracle compile must finish with exit0 and no timeout. Both check and build rows depend on oracle_valid; runtime outcome validity is checked before exact equality.",
    "Rust app receives --check in reference and measured native executions; checked-in comment explicitly describes ordinary-main match. Both Rust and ZIL test exact result 475000738663; Rust assertion failures signal/abort and ZIL returns1, so wrong computation cannot agree with valid expected0.",
    "Reference ZIL is labeled baseline, consumes identical .zil inputs and same default cache/codegen options; it is never presented as a Rust arm.",
    "23 generated families include independent body/type ResourceLimit controls, explicit chain and fanout source dependencies. Fanout expected weighting counts module0 once per leaf-root contribution; chain root counts each leaf once.",
    "Full 4-byte little-endian expected arithmetic result, current executable deletion, per-request source SHA identity/edit tags, JSON/Verify requirements, timeout/launch/native failures and null failed-cell ratios are retained.",
    "Complete modes and all declared outcomes are kept; explicit closed export contract stays separate from default.",
    "Six AB/BA blocks give three first-position blocks per arm; each sequence has dedicated persistent cache. Native execution is outside compiler timer. Source generation and source hashing are outside timer.",
    "Protocol names CLI check metadata differences, same-workload versus different internal work, rustc not Cargo/IDE, LLVM version difference, cache limitations, OS page cache retained, and representative-workload limits."
  ],
